{
  "schema": "loom.runtime_profile/1",
  "domain": "server_accounts",
  "revision": 6,
  "description": "loom-server accounts (P1). All values are presets, not rules (owner rule). registration: open = anyone may create an account, invite = only with a code made by 'loom-server user invite', closed = accounts are created by the operator CLI only. Sessions are random tokens stored only as SHA-256. Argon2id parameters come from the named preset of the storage_security pack (crypto.params.argon2id_presets); stored hashes carry their own parameters, so changing the preset never invalidates existing passwords. Overlay: <accounts_root>/profiles/server_accounts.pack. throttle (R43, security reason: stops online password guessing, which Argon2id cost alone only slows): after free_attempts failed logins for one login (per_login) or from one client address (per_ip) further attempts are refused with 429 for base_delay_seconds * 2^(failures - free_attempts), capped at max_delay_seconds; failures are forgotten after reset_seconds without a new one. mode off disables it. The address is the TCP peer unless trust_forwarded_for is true (set it only behind your own reverse proxy). Isolation (R18, security review): confine_paths = every filesystem path a request supplies (catalog/archive/knowledge sources, a repo, a local storage target, a prompt folder) must lie inside the user's own data directory or one of path_roots, so one account cannot read another's data or the accounts database; false lifts it (single-operator installs). block_private_hosts = outbound requests of an account to loopback/private/link-local addresses are refused (stops using the server as a proxy into its own network) except to the hosts in allow_private_hosts (e.g. a local model server). csrf.check_origin = a state-changing request that carries an Origin (or Sec-Fetch-Site: cross-site) naming another site than the one it was sent to is refused, unless that origin is in csrf.allowed_origins. expose_server_logs = /api/logs shows the process-wide log, which mixes all users, so it is off for accounts. Hashing (R20): hashing.max_concurrent = how many Argon2id evaluations (login, register, password change) may run at the same time, because each takes its full memory (rfc9106_second = 64 MiB): -1 = number of CPUs (preset), 0 = unlimited, N = at most N. A request that finds every slot taken waits up to hashing.wait_seconds (preset 5) and is then answered 503 with Retry-After; 0 = refuse at once. login_max_length (R20): the longest login (counted in characters) that register and login accept; 0 = no limit. Longer names are refused with 400 before any hashing or throttle bookkeeping, so one request cannot grow the account tables or the throttle memory. Operator ceilings (R20 follow-up): zip.max_total_bytes / zip.max_ratio (0 = no ceiling) and git.allow_repo_config bound what an account may set in its own config.json (loom_zip_*, loom_git_allow_repo_config): the effective value is the more restrictive of the two, so a user can tighten but not loosen; they protect the server's disk and the server's processes. Single-user and local runtimes have no ceiling. Guests (R103 B1, presets): guests.enabled (false = no use without an account; the public address gets guests only after the abuse protection of package B2), guests.start (auto = the first visit starts a guest session and shows the full interface without any gate; explicit = only on a button), guests.first_answer_notice (one non-blocking notice after the first answer; ask_again per_device | per_session | never), guests.workdir (subdir under the accounts root holding one ordinary Loom data directory per guest; idle_ttl_seconds = the directory and the session disappear after that long without a request, 0 = never by itself; max_bytes = operator ceiling, 0 = none, enforced from B2; keep_after_session ask | never | always), guests.sweep_interval_seconds (how often expired guests are looked for), guests.keys_file (KEY=VALUE file of the operator's provider keys; read into memory and handed to a guest runtime through credential_overlay, never written to the guest directory; empty = none), guests.model_sources (order of model sources, open list), guests.secrets_routes (write_only_session = a guest never reads a key, pool keys are never listed). Guest protection (R103 B2, guests.protection, every number a preset; 0 = no limit, the mechanism is then off): pow (proof of work when a guest session starts, instead of a captcha: GET /api/auth/guest/challenge gives a challenge, the client finds a nonce so that SHA-256(challenge:nonce) starts with `bits` zero bits; bits_under_load applies once the live guest sessions reach load_share of global.live_sessions; challenge_ttl_seconds; invited off = a valid invitation code skips it); per_session token buckets (chat_per_minute, chat_per_day, output_tokens_per_day counted from the provider's usage or estimated as characters / estimate_chars_per_token, parallel_streams, api_per_minute for every API request); per_address (the client address, behind your own proxy with throttle.trust_forwarded_for; an address is a hint, not a person — NAT — so these are looser and the words say there is a lot of traffic from the address): sessions_per_hour, chat_per_minute; global: live_sessions, pool_chat_per_day and pool_output_tokens_per_day (the daily ceiling of the operator's free-key pool shared by all guests); sizes: max_body_bytes, max_upload_bytes for guests (lower than the server's); outbound: only_provider_hosts = a guest runtime reaches only the hosts of the free provider manifests plus extra_hosts (false = every public host); model_routes = which requests count as model requests (open list). Exceeding a limit answers 429 with retry_after (seconds) and words in the request's language from `words` (open map of languages); rejections are counted per mechanism (no content) in GET /api/pool/summary.",
  "defaults": {
    "registration": "closed",
    "session_lifetime_seconds": 2592000,
    "session_idle_seconds": 0,
    "password_min_length": 8,
    "argon2id_preset": "rfc9106_second",
    "session_token_bytes": 32,
    "accounts_file": "accounts.sqlite",
    "users_subdir": "users",
    "cookie": {
      "name": "loom_session",
      "http_only": true,
      "same_site": "Strict",
      "secure": "auto",
      "path": "/"
    },
    "throttle": {
      "mode": "on",
      "reset_seconds": 900,
      "trust_forwarded_for": false,
      "per_login": {
        "free_attempts": 5,
        "base_delay_seconds": 1,
        "max_delay_seconds": 900
      },
      "per_ip": {
        "free_attempts": 20,
        "base_delay_seconds": 1,
        "max_delay_seconds": 900
      }
    },
    "confine_paths": true,
    "path_roots": [],
    "block_private_hosts": true,
    "allow_private_hosts": [],
    "csrf": {
      "check_origin": true,
      "allowed_origins": []
    },
    "expose_server_logs": false,
    "hashing": {
      "max_concurrent": -1,
      "wait_seconds": 5
    },
    "login_max_length": 128,
    "zip": {
      "max_total_bytes": 68719476736,
      "max_ratio": 1000
    },
    "git": {
      "allow_repo_config": false
    },
    "guests": {
      "enabled": false,
      "start": "auto",
      "first_answer_notice": {
        "on": true,
        "ask_again": "per_device"
      },
      "workdir": {
        "subdir": "guests",
        "idle_ttl_seconds": 86400,
        "max_bytes": 268435456,
        "keep_after_session": "ask"
      },
      "sweep_interval_seconds": 60,
      "keys_file": "~/.config/chatadhd/keys.env",
      "secrets_routes": "write_only_session",
      "model_sources": [
        "byok",
        "pool",
        "free",
        "local"
      ],
      "protection": {
        "pow": {
          "bits": 18,
          "bits_under_load": 21,
          "load_share": 0.5,
          "challenge_ttl_seconds": 300,
          "invited": "off"
        },
        "per_session": {
          "chat_per_minute": 20,
          "chat_per_day": 300,
          "output_tokens_per_day": 200000,
          "estimate_chars_per_token": 4,
          "parallel_streams": 2,
          "api_per_minute": 600
        },
        "per_address": {
          "sessions_per_hour": 20,
          "chat_per_minute": 60
        },
        "global": {
          "live_sessions": 200,
          "pool_chat_per_day": 5000,
          "pool_output_tokens_per_day": 3000000
        },
        "sizes": {
          "max_body_bytes": 1048576,
          "max_upload_bytes": 52428800
        },
        "outbound": {
          "only_provider_hosts": true,
          "extra_hosts": []
        },
        "model_routes": [
          "POST /api/chat"
        ],
        "words": {
          "en": {
            "pow_required": "Starting a visit without an account needs a short computation in the browser first (it protects the free models from scripts). Reload the page and it happens by itself.",
            "pow_invalid": "The browser's computation did not check out or is too old. Reload the page to try again.",
            "session_chat_minute": "That was many questions in one minute. You can ask again in {{wait}}.",
            "session_chat_day": "The free questions of this visit for today are used up. The next one is possible in {{wait}}.",
            "session_output_tokens_day": "The free models have written a lot for this visit today. More is possible in {{wait}}.",
            "session_parallel_streams": "Answers are already being written in other tabs. Wait for one to finish ({{wait}}).",
            "session_api_minute": "Very many requests in one minute from this visit. It goes on in {{wait}}.",
            "address_sessions_hour": "A lot of traffic from this address today — many visits without an account have started from it. A new one is possible in {{wait}}.",
            "address_chat_minute": "A lot of traffic from this address right now. You can ask again in {{wait}}.",
            "global_live_sessions": "Very many people are using the server without an account right now. Try again in {{wait}}.",
            "pool_chat_day": "The free models of this server are used up for today. It goes on in {{wait}}.",
            "pool_output_tokens_day": "The free models of this server have written their daily share. It goes on in {{wait}}.",
            "size_body": "This is more than a visit without an account can send at once ({{limit}}).",
            "workdir_full": "The working folder of this visit is full ({{limit}}). Download the archive or sign in to keep more.",
            "alternatives": "Meanwhile you can use your own key, another model source, or sign in."
          },
          "pl": {
            "pow_required": "Wizyta bez konta zaczyna się od krótkiego obliczenia w przeglądarce (chroni darmowe modele przed skryptami). Odśwież stronę, a zrobi się samo.",
            "pow_invalid": "Obliczenie przeglądarki się nie zgadza albo jest za stare. Odśwież stronę, żeby spróbować jeszcze raz.",
            "session_chat_minute": "To było dużo pytań w jedną minutę. Kolejne możesz zadać za {{wait}}.",
            "session_chat_day": "Darmowe pytania tej wizyty na dziś się skończyły. Następne będzie możliwe za {{wait}}.",
            "session_output_tokens_day": "Darmowe modele napisały dziś dla tej wizyty dużo tekstu. Więcej będzie możliwe za {{wait}}.",
            "session_parallel_streams": "W innych kartach już powstają odpowiedzi. Poczekaj, aż któraś się skończy ({{wait}}).",
            "session_api_minute": "Bardzo dużo żądań z tej wizyty w jedną minutę. Dalej za {{wait}}.",
            "address_sessions_hour": "Z tego adresu jest dziś dużo ruchu — zaczęło się z niego wiele wizyt bez konta. Nowa będzie możliwa za {{wait}}.",
            "address_chat_minute": "Z tego adresu jest teraz dużo ruchu. Kolejne pytanie możesz zadać za {{wait}}.",
            "global_live_sessions": "Bardzo wiele osób korzysta teraz z serwera bez konta. Spróbuj za {{wait}}.",
            "pool_chat_day": "Darmowe modele tego serwera są na dziś wyczerpane. Dalej za {{wait}}.",
            "pool_output_tokens_day": "Darmowe modele tego serwera napisały już swoją dzienną część. Dalej za {{wait}}.",
            "size_body": "To więcej, niż wizyta bez konta może wysłać naraz ({{limit}}).",
            "workdir_full": "Folder roboczy tej wizyty jest pełny ({{limit}}). Pobierz archiwum albo zaloguj się, żeby trzymać więcej.",
            "alternatives": "W tym czasie możesz użyć własnego klucza, innego źródła modelu albo się zalogować."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "value_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": [
      "registration",
      "session_lifetime_seconds",
      "session_idle_seconds",
      "password_min_length",
      "argon2id_preset",
      "session_token_bytes",
      "accounts_file",
      "users_subdir",
      "cookie",
      "throttle",
      "confine_paths",
      "path_roots",
      "block_private_hosts",
      "allow_private_hosts",
      "csrf",
      "expose_server_logs",
      "hashing",
      "login_max_length",
      "zip",
      "git"
    ],
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "registration": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "open",
          "invite",
          "closed"
        ],
        "description": "Who may create accounts over HTTP.",
        "x-setting": "/registration",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "session_lifetime_seconds": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 1,
        "maximum": 9223372036854775807,
        "x-unit": "seconds",
        "x-setting": "/session_lifetime_seconds",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "session_idle_seconds": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0,
        "maximum": 9223372036854775807,
        "description": "0 = no idle expiry.",
        "x-unit": "seconds",
        "x-setting": "/session_idle_seconds",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "password_min_length": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 1,
        "maximum": 2147483647,
        "x-setting": "/password_min_length",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "argon2id_preset": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "description": "Id in storage_security crypto.params.argon2id_presets.",
        "x-setting": "/argon2id_preset",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "session_token_bytes": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 16,
        "maximum": 1024,
        "x-setting": "/session_token_bytes",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "accounts_file": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "x-setting": "/accounts_file",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "users_subdir": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "x-setting": "/users_subdir",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "cookie": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "http_only",
          "same_site",
          "secure",
          "path"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "x-setting": "/cookie",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts",
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "http_only": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "same_site": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "Strict",
              "Lax",
              "None"
            ]
          },
          "secure": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "auto",
              "always",
              "never"
            ],
            "description": "auto = Secure when the request arrived over TLS or X-Forwarded-Proto: https."
          },
          "path": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "throttle": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "mode",
          "reset_seconds",
          "trust_forwarded_for",
          "per_login",
          "per_ip"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "x-setting": "/throttle",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts login",
        "properties": {
          "mode": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "on",
              "off"
            ]
          },
          "reset_seconds": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 2147483647,
            "x-unit": "seconds"
          },
          "trust_forwarded_for": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "per_login": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "free_attempts",
              "base_delay_seconds",
              "max_delay_seconds"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "free_attempts": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 2147483647
              },
              "base_delay_seconds": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 2147483647,
                "x-unit": "seconds"
              },
              "max_delay_seconds": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 2147483647,
                "x-unit": "seconds"
              }
            }
          },
          "per_ip": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "free_attempts",
              "base_delay_seconds",
              "max_delay_seconds"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "free_attempts": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 2147483647
              },
              "base_delay_seconds": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 2147483647,
                "x-unit": "seconds"
              },
              "max_delay_seconds": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 2147483647,
                "x-unit": "seconds"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "confine_paths": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "description": "Request-supplied filesystem paths must be inside the user's data dir or path_roots.",
        "x-setting": "/confine_paths",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "path_roots": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "description": "Extra absolute folders every account may read (e.g. a shared library). Empty = only the user's own data dir.",
        "x-setting": "/path_roots",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "block_private_hosts": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "description": "Refuse outbound requests to loopback/private/link-local addresses.",
        "x-setting": "/block_private_hosts",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "allow_private_hosts": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "description": "Host names or IP literals exempt from block_private_hosts.",
        "x-setting": "/allow_private_hosts",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "csrf": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "check_origin",
          "allowed_origins"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "x-setting": "/csrf",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts",
        "properties": {
          "check_origin": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "allowed_origins": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            },
            "description": "Origins such as https://app.example.org that may send cookie-authenticated requests cross-site."
          }
        }
      },
      "expose_server_logs": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "description": "Serve the process-wide /api/logs to signed-in users (it mixes every user's lines).",
        "x-setting": "/expose_server_logs",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "hashing": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "max_concurrent",
          "wait_seconds"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "x-setting": "/hashing",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts",
        "properties": {
          "max_concurrent": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": -1,
            "description": "Concurrent Argon2id evaluations: -1 = number of CPUs, 0 = unlimited, N = at most N."
          },
          "wait_seconds": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "description": "How long a request waits for a free slot before it gets 503 + Retry-After; 0 = refuse at once."
          }
        }
      },
      "login_max_length": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0,
        "description": "Longest login in characters; 0 = no limit.",
        "x-setting": "/login_max_length",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts"
      },
      "zip": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "max_total_bytes",
          "max_ratio"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "x-setting": "/zip",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts",
        "properties": {
          "max_total_bytes": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "description": "Ceiling on bytes one imported archive may expand to for any account; 0 = no ceiling."
          },
          "max_ratio": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "description": "Ceiling on the expansion ratio of one archive entry; 0 = no ceiling."
          }
        }
      },
      "git": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "allow_repo_config"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "x-setting": "/git",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts",
        "properties": {
          "allow_repo_config": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "true lets accounts opt in (loom_git_allow_repo_config) to running git with a repository's own hooks and configuration; false forbids it."
          }
        }
      },
      "guests": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Use without an account (R103). Every value is a preset.",
        "x-setting": "/guests",
        "x-consumer": "server accounts guests",
        "properties": {
          "enabled": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "start": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "auto | explicit (open value)."
          },
          "first_answer_notice": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
